      "item_body": "<p>[A]</p><p>The number of rabbits in a forest at time t, in months, is R(t) = 500[10 + e^(-t/10)].</p><p>a. What is the initial number of rabbits in the forest?</p><p>b. Determine the rate of change of the number of rabbits at time t.</p><p>c. How fast is the number of rabbits changing after one year?</p><p>d. Determine the largest number of rabbits in the forest during the first three years.</p><p>e. Use graphing technology to graph R versus t. Give physical reasons why the population of rabbits might behave this way.</p>",
